#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""dvpnctl - Sentinel dVPN full-tunnel + kill-switch controller.

Wraps the official `sentinel-dvpncli` so that:
  * all traffic is routed through the WireGuard tunnel (AllowedIPs 0.0.0.0/0),
  * a host kill switch drops anything that would otherwise leak to clearnet
    (the SDK writes the wg-quick PostUp/PreDown iptables rules for us),
  * the tunnel is owned by a systemd unit so it stays up until you deactivate it,
  * endpoints can be switched in one command.

Not affiliated with, and with no dependency on, MathNodes/meile. The only
required runtime dependency is the official Sentinel CLI (sentinel-dvpncli v5).

The privileged pieces (systemd unit, wg-quick) are installed by ./install.sh.
User-level commands here only need the wallet keyring and the chain.

Tunables live in ~/.config/dvpnctl/config.json (see DEFAULTS below).
"""

